        "commit_message": "Hopefully fixes https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/7905 (or at\nleast will do when merged into the relevant branch)\n\nWe should always use our wrapping of it (which may be expanded to\nnothing or our own implementation if using multi-phase init). On the\nabi3t implementation this ends up being a compile time issue because we\ndon't have a ModuleDef, but it's a still wrong in regular builds.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: scoder <stefan_ml@behnel.de>",
