    "body": "Hopefully fixes https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/7905 (or at least will do when merged into the relevant branch)\r\n\r\nWe should always use our wrapping of it (which may be expanded to nothing or our own implementation if using multi-phase init). On the abi3t implementation this ends up being a compile time issue because we don't have a ModuleDef, but it's a still wrong in regular builds.",
